3
00:00:06.792 --> 00:00:10.189
The recipient has not yet confirmed deletion. Safest response:

4
00:00:10.189 --> 00:00:13.585
Option B: Notify the privacy/security incident channel promptly, preserve

5
00:00:13.585 --> 00:00:16.981
